    Section 8 Amazon S3

S3 Overview
    Section Introduction
        Amazon S3 is one of the main building blocks of AWS
        Advertised as "infinetly scaling" storage
        Many websites use Amazon S3 as backbone
        Many AWS services use S3 as an integration as well
    Amazon S3 Use cases (Nasdaq and Sysco)
        Backup and storage
        Disaster Recovery
        Archive 
        Hybrid Cloud Storage
        Application hosting 
        Media hosting 
        Data lakes and big data analytics
        Software delivery
        Static website
